Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,บ้าน่า
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,บยองกู
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,บยองกู
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,คุณยุนโฮ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,รีบหนีไป...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,คุณ... ยุน... โฮ...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,รีบหนีไป...
